      "content": "thanks for that. so when i'm teaching the section on \"stubborn\" or \"regressive\" views, how should i frame them to the kids? i don't want to make it sound like they're just being mean or wrong for no reason, but since they're resisting change, should i characterize them as being stuck in the past or just not understanding how the world works now?",
